OL,3,GNEWSAWhat is behind plans for an over
OL,4,A#100m wind farm?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn onshore wind farm that would be one
OL,7,Fof England's largest has been proposed
OL,8,Fon the border of Cambridgeshire,
OL,9,FNorfolk and Suffolk. If built, it would
OL,10,Fcost in excess of #100m. What are the
OL,11,Fplans and what do people think of them?
OL,13,FThe proposals for Redmere Wind Farm
OL,14,Fcome from Swedish company Vattenfall
OL,15,Fand would see up to 32 turbines, which
OL,16,Fare up to 721ft (220m) tall, built on
OL,17,Fland around Shippea Hill.
OL,19,FTo give a sense of scale, Ely Cathedral
OL,20,F- roughly seven miles away - is 66m
OL,21,F(216ft) at its highest point.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
