OL,3,GNEWSAWhat is behind plans for an over
OL,4,A#100m wind farm?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe company hopes the development could
OL,7,Fpower nearly 220,000 homes a year, with
OL,8,Fplans due to be formally submitted in
OL,9,Fautumn 2027.
